      "page": 1,
      "score": 0.574
    },
    {
      "doc_id": 659e3,
      "text_span": "We train a 2.7 billion and 13 billion causally masked model on this data which we call CM3-Medium and CM3-Large respectively. Extensive experiments demonstrate that these models are able to perform a wide range of zero-shot uni- and cross-modal tasks.",
